---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-neutral-200 bg-gradient-to-b from-accent-50/60 to-white">
 <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:px-8 lg:py-28">
 <div class="animate-fade-in">
 <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent-200 bg-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-accent-700">
 <Icon name="Zap" size={14} /> Portal Otomotif Terpercaya
 </span>
 <h1 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
 Satu Langkah Lebih Dekat ke Kendaraan Impian Anda
 </h1>
 <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
 Jelajahi katalog mobil dan motor pilihan, baca ulasan mendalam dari tim redaksi kami, dan hitung simulasi
 kredit hanya dalam hitungan menit, semuanya tersedia dalam satu portal terpercaya.
 </p>
 <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
 <a
  href="/vehicles"
  class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-accent-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-accent-700"
>
  <span class="leading-none">Jelajahi Katalog</span>
  <Icon name="ArrowRight" size={20} class="shrink-0" />
</a>
 <a
 href="/news"
 class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-700 transition-colors hover:border-accent-500"
 >
 Baca Berita <Icon name="Newspaper" size={16} />
 </a>
 </div>
 <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 border-t border-neutral-200 pt-6">
 <div>
 <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900">10+</p>
 <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Kendaraan</p>
 </div>
 <div>
 <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900">8</p>
 <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Brand</p>
 </div>
 <div>
 <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900">10+</p>
 <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Artikel</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="relative animate-fade-in">
 <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-xl">
 <img
 src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/2022_Hyundai_Creta_Prime_(Indonesia)_front_view.jpg"
 alt="Hyundai Creta Prime, salah satu SUV pilihan di OtoPortal"
 class="h-full w-full object-cover"
 width="1200"
 height="900"
 />
 </div>
 <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 hidden rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-lg sm:block">
 <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Cicilan mulai dari</p>
 <p class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Rp2,5 Juta/bulan</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>
